Rāvaṇa meets ascetic Vēdavatī in Himālaya --- Rāvaṇa questions birth husband and harsh vow --- Vēdavatī tells Kuśadhvaja Br̥haspati-line Vāṇī birth and Viṣṇu-dedicated father --- Vēdavatī tells Śambhu murder and mother fire entry --- Vēdavatī vows tapas for Nārāyaṇa husband --- Rāvaṇa scorns Viṣṇu and presses suit --- Rāvaṇa touches her hair --- Vēdavatī cuts hair and enters fire vowing ayōnija rebirth as Sītā
